stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Created
    Created --> Queued: schedule reminder
    Queued --> Sent: dispatch succeeds
    Queued --> RetryPending: transient dispatch failure
    RetryPending --> Sent: retry succeeds
    RetryPending --> Failed: retry limit exceeded
    Sent --> Read: user opens notification
    Sent --> Expired: validity window ends
    Read --> Archived: cleanup or user action
    Failed --> Archived: maintenance cleanup
    Expired --> Archived: maintenance cleanup
    Archived --> [*]
